meta {
  name: update-drug
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

patch {
  url: {{baseURL}}/inventory/drugs/{{drugId}}
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
    "strength": "500 mg",
    "form": "Capsule",
    "unit": "Pack"
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Update Drug

  Partially updates a drug belonging to the authenticated workspace.

  ## Authorization

  Requires an authenticated user with an active workspace membership.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `drugId` | UUID | Yes | Drug to update. Replace `{{drugId}}` with an ID from the list/create request. |

  ## Request Body

  Every field is optional; include only fields that should change.

  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | `name` | string | Updated drug name. |
  | `genericName` | string | Updated active pharmaceutical ingredient. |
  | `strength` | string | Updated strength label. |
  | `form` | string | Updated dosage form. |
  | `unit` | string | Updated stock-counting unit. |

  ## Success Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Drug updated successfully",
    "data": {
      "drug": {
        "id": "drug-uuid",
        "name": "Amoxil",
        "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
        "strength": "500 mg",
        "form": "Capsule",
        "unit": "Pack",
        "isActive": true
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Existing batches and stock logs continue referencing the same drug ID.
  - The update is workspace-scoped; a valid drug ID from another workspace behaves as not found.
  - Activity state is changed through the separate drug-action endpoint.

  ## Errors

  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Authentication is invalid or workspace access is suspended. |
  | `404 Not Found` | No matching drug exists in the authenticated workspace. |
  | `422 Unprocessable Entity` | The UUID or body is invalid. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | The update failed unexpectedly. |
}
